<title>USA: Livestock/meat crossings at U.S./Canadian border.</title>
<headline>Livestock/meat crossings at U.S./Canadian border.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Canada reported the following preliminary livestock and meat crossings at the U.S./Canadian border. - USDA</p>
<p>Canadian Imports from the U.S.:		    yr to   yr ago</p>
<p>			03/29/97 03/22/97 03/30/96   date    to date</p>
<p>Livestock/in head</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:	0	 94	2 :     814	 802</p>
<p>Heifers:		   0	 48	6 :     406	 188</p>
<p>Cows:		    615	557    346 :   9,724     5,714</p>
<p>Bulls:		    25	 56     19 :     506	 143</p>
<p>Totals		   640	755    373 :  11,450     6,847</p>
